  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.15,
   "speechStart": 0.15,
   "end": 5.3,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Last, the radio, which is a navigation tool as much as a safety one."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 5.55,
   "speechStart": 5.55,
   "end": 8.6,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "VHF range is roughly line of sight."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 8.85,
   "speechStart": 8.85,
   "end": 12.925,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "So what gives you more range: more power, or a higher antenna?"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 13.175,
   "speechStart": 13.925,
   "end": 15.75,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "The higher antenna."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 16.0,
   "speechStart": 16.0,
   "end": 17.975,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Now the channels to know."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 18.225,
   "speechStart": 18.225,
   "end": 21.45,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Sixteen is distress, safety and calling."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 21.7,
   "speechStart": 21.7,
   "end": 25.925,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Nine is the alternate calling channel for recreational boats."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 26.175,
   "speechStart": 26.175,
   "end": 30.05,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Thirteen is bridge-to-bridge, where the ships and tugs talk."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 30.3,
   "speechStart": 30.3,
   "end": 34.175,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "And twenty-two alpha is the Coast Guard’s working channel."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 34.425,
   "speechStart": 34.425,
   "end": 43.425,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "For the DSC distress button to do its job, the radio needs two things: a registered MMSI number, and a GPS connection."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 43.675,
   "speechStart": 43.675,
   "end": 48.425,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "And the weather channels carry NOAA Weather Radio around the clock."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 48.675,
   "speechStart": 48.675,
   "end": 50.65,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "That’s lesson eleven."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 50.9,
   "speechStart": 50.9,
   "end": 53.45,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "GPS course comes from movement."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 53.7,
   "speechStart": 53.7,
   "end": 55.75,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Check every leg of a route."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 56.0,
   "speechStart": 56.0,
   "end": 58.075,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "AIS isn’t in sight."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 58.325,
   "speechStart": 58.325,
   "end": 60.75,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Know what your depth reading means."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 61.0,
   "speechStart": 61.0,
   "end": 63.15,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Next time: radar."
  }
